  "title": "Soft, Chewy Rosh Hashanah Honey-Walnut Cookies",
  "description": "Moist, soft, and chewy cookies flavored with honey, walnuts, cinnamon, brown sugar, and vanilla. This recipe is perfect for Rosh Hashanah or any time.",
